{
  "name": "Save website form leads to Google Sheets, alert Slack and auto-reply with Gmail",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "34d74316-65a8-4020-862b-62a01ddc7545",
      "name": "Template description",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -560,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 900,
        "content": "## Save website form leads to Google Sheets, alert Slack and auto-reply with Gmail\n\n### Who is this for\nSmall businesses, consultants and agencies who want every website enquiry captured, shared with the team and answered within seconds.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Form webhook** receives a POST with name, email, message (and optional source).\n2. **Clean & validate** trims fields and checks the email format.\n3. **Valid email?** drops submissions with a bad email.\n4. **Save lead** appends the lead to your Google Sheet.\n5. **Ping Slack** posts the lead to your channel.\n6. **Auto-reply** emails the lead a thank-you from your Gmail.\n7. **Respond OK** returns a success response to the form.\n\n### How to set up\n1. Create a Google Sheet with columns: received_at, name, email, message, source.\n2. Attach credentials to **Save lead** (Google Sheets), **Ping Slack** (Slack) and **Auto-reply** (Gmail).\n3. Paste your sheet URL and set your Slack channel.\n4. Edit the auto-reply text and sign-off.\n5. Point your form (Webflow, WordPress, Tally, HTML) at the webhook Test URL, send a test, then activate and switch to the Production URL.\n\n### What you need\nn8n (Cloud or self-hosted), Google Sheets, Gmail and a Slack workspace. No paid apps.\n\n### How to customise\nAdd lead scoring in **Clean & validate**, route by source with a Switch node, or replace Slack with Telegram or Microsoft Teams.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a0c3dac3-97ec-4267-85b2-5d6daad3b336",
      "name": "Form webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "website-lead-form",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "bf01863c-6fbf-428a-b7f8-2cecefb5930c",
      "name": "Clean & validate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const b=$input.first().json.body||{};\nconst email=String(b.email||'').trim().toLowerCase();\nconst valid=/^[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+$/.test(email);\nreturn [{json:{received_at:new Date().toISOString(),name:String(b.name||'there').trim(),email,message:String(b.message||'').slice(0,2000),source:String(b.source||'website'),valid}}];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
